      "content": "yeah but that's the thing. what if i'm not \"trusting my own reality.\" what if my reality is just... that i am actually difficult. that i do push people away. that i have hurt people\n\nlike i look at the pattern. every relationship in my life has ended with me being the one who's \"too much.\" not just family. friends, a couple long-term relationships. at some point isn't the common denominator just me\n\nand i'm 34 and i have no one. like actually no one. i don't know what i'm supposed to do with that",
